// Matrix.fol — package source file
// Spec: language-ref.md > Matrix — Two Parameter Type Constructor
//
// A type constructor may take more than one value index. Both indices become
// part of the resulting type's identity, so the compiler can prove that the
// columns of A match the rows of B before any multiplication runs.

_ co.unit = {
Matrix(r co.int, c co.int)->(co.dependentType) =
    co.int->([r, c]);
}
